WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:08.180
Lock a month once it is reviewed, so nothing can be posted into it by mistake.

2
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:14.700
When a month is reviewed, close it. The overview shows which month is closed last.

3
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.230
Choose Close a month.

4
00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:25.270
Before closing, the office checks the month: entries waiting, receipts not posted, the bank not reconciled.

5
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:31.850
If something is open, you see it here, with a link to fix it.

6
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:36.650
Add a note for the record.

7
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:45.840
Some checks are optional, like supplier bills still to approve. If you are sure, tick Close anyway.

8
00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:53.820
Close the month. Nothing can be posted on or before that date any more, from any module.

9
00:00:53.830 --> 00:01:00.470
Need a correction? A manager can reopen the last closed month, and it is logged.

10
00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:07.270
At the end of the year, close the year: the result moves to retained earnings.
